{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル、9公演が終わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日がちょうど折り返し地点みたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ半分かぁぁ～～ぃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じるくらい毎日が濃い日々であります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでにやらせていただいた役は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポリン姫、エステル、ルイーダ、エルザ、キャサリン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンサンブルのメグ、侍女3と4"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの役も楽しいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに多様なキャラの役にチャレンジできるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく勉強になります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日キャストがちがうので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2幕ではセリフが思い出せない人もいたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルならではで、逆にそれも見所かもしれない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれで適当になってしまうのはこわいので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、大好きな舞台だし、選ばれたなら責任もあるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをフォローできるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って覚えていけたらと思ってます！o(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメディーなのに真面目すぎるかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕方ない。私はこういう人間だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/06/06/6664659/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の高3クインテット☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん・ちーちゃん・みおな・きーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒の楽屋で近くの席なんだ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな強い気持ちもってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2幕に出るための1幕コントオーディションは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直苦戦するけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切り替えてやってみてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からもみなさんに楽しんでもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るぞっ*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}